      "writtenOn": "2017-03-07T21:13:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That\u0027s a good point. Unfortunately WifiNative/VendorHal doesn\u0027t give the specific reason of the failure. Most likely it is just the issue with this particular feature. Probably what we should do is to fall back to the framework roaming if either getRoamingCapabilities failed or the returned max list size was invalid. It\u0027s probably too much to reload firmware. In case the whole firmware is screwed, other more significant failures should trigger that. \n\nWill make the change and add unit tests for that.",
      "parentUuid": "e6d1dda3_434dc505",
